# T-1066 Step 2b fast-path: zero-param alias with no TyCon references in body.
# expand_named returns the body directly (Arc::clone) without pushing to the
# expansion stack or calling expand_all_tycon_apps.
#
# body_contains_tycon_ref returns false for a record body [id: Int] (no bare
# TyCon references). The fast-path short-circuits all expansion work.
#
# At runtime: structural record alias entries are skipped (TypeAlias with named-key
# body is not evaluated into the dict). Only `result` appears in output.
#
# At typecheck: clean — no type warnings.
[
  IdRecord: [type [id: Int]]
  result: 42
]
=== out
["IdRecord": []  "result": 42]
